      "message": "Thank you for bringing this into our attention!\n\nThe doc is more updated than this comment and the code below. This system property has no effect now. You can delete the comment and the code altogether.\n\nFor \"eng\" builds, we now use [a new way](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/make/target/product/runtime_libart.mk;l\u003d129-146;drc\u003df281230b2959d46f40290fdd39c3284034b0194c) to disable all dexpreopt and dexopt.",
